  "title": "Billy S NDE 5069/5067 NDE 5067",
  "date": "August 1974 | July 1966",
  "content": "5069 I was practicing a choke hold on another Marine and then he held my neck and that was when I felt my spirit rise above my body. I looked up and saw a dark tunnel with the same bright light I saw when I was 11 and very sick. I saw my mom and dad standing on each side of the tunnel. Both are now deceased, but were alive at the time of this NDE. Again, I was pulled towards the light and felt a warm glowing light surround me. I had no worries. Time seemed to stop and I had no ill feelings of want or need or hurry. It felt amazing and wonderful. I knew I was headed home, as it seemed that way. The next moment I woke up with the drill instructor standing over me. It was rather disappointing when I realized where I was.\n\nI was practicing a choke hold on another Marine and then he held my neck and that was when I felt my spirit rise above my body. I looked up and saw a dark tunnel with the same bright light I saw when I was 11 and very sick. I saw my mom and dad standing on each side of the tunnel. Both are now deceased, but were alive at the time of this NDE. Again, I was pulled towards the light and felt a warm glowing light surround me. I had no worries. Time seemed to stop and I had no ill feelings of want or need or hurry. It felt amazing and wonderful. I knew I was headed home, as it seemed that way. The next moment I woke up with the drill instructor standing over me. It was rather disappointing when I realized where I was.",
